### DEBE FALLAR (401) - Usar token revocado
GET http://localhost:8080/api/entrenamientos
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_REVOCADO


### ========================================
### FASE 6: DESHABILITAR 2FA
### ========================================

### DEBE FUNCIONAR - Deshabilitar 2FA
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/2fa/disable
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiJ9.eyJyb2wiOiJVU0VSIiwic3ViIjoidGVzdHVzZXIiLCJpYXQiOjE3Njk5NjYwNTAsImV4cCI6MTc2OTk2OTY1MH0.FjgO09JO1rYbi8JTuatPmnO6XJJCA2NfoaXV32FHPlRcvWLstQRpFZfxGovENWE56oisSI4LBcJmIW_BLZPMyw

### DEBE FUNCIONAR - Login sin 2FA
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "Test123456"
}


### ========================================
### FASE 7: CASOS DE ERROR
### ========================================

### DEBE FALLAR (401) - Credenciales incorrectas
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "password_incorrecta"
}

### DEBE FALLAR (400) - Email inválido en registro
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser2",
  "password": "Test123456",
  "email": "email-invalido",
  "nombre": "Usuario de Prueba 2",
  "rol": "USER"
}

### DEBE FALLAR (401) - Código 2FA inválido
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/2fa/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "codigo": "000000"
}

### DEBE FALLAR (401) - Verificar 2FA sin login previo
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/2fa/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "usuarioquenoexiste",
  "codigo": "123456"
}

### DEBE FALLAR (401) - Refresh token inválido
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "token.invalido.aqui",
  "accessToken": "token.invalido.aqui"
}


